## Enemy spawn roster. Each entry: { id, name, pos, and any Enemy @export to override
## per-instance }. Spread up the tower, every few platforms, so the climb is contested
## without swarming any one ledge. Alternating Kebus (melee + straight bolt) and Baghel
## (ranged ground surge).
##
## STOP ENEMIES FROM "HOMING" YOU: it's the `ranged_mode` export. "aimed" (the default)
## points each shot at the player's torso the moment it fires -- that tracking is what
## reads as homing (the projectile itself never steers; homing=0 for enemies). "forward"
## fires straight ahead in the enemy's facing instead, so a shot only hits if you're in
## its line. Every entry here is "forward". (Separately, `aggro` = false, the default,
## keeps them guarding their platform rather than chasing you.)
